  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the Loggerhead Turtle in the Western Mediterranean: coordinated solutions for the bycatch reduction in the foraging population of the Comunidad Valenciana (Spain).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will 1. evaluate marine turtle bycatch in artisianal fisheries operating in ports of Valencia Province with onborard observers; 2. conduct a preliminary analysis of the maritime recreational fisheries in Valencia and promote proper care of captured sea turtles; 3. conduct sea turtle conservation awareness campaign in newpapers , with newsletters and other means; 4. Support the Turtle Gazette newspaper for fisherman with 4 publications annually; and 4. work with the 59 coastal municipalities of Valenica to advance conservation of the loggerhead relative to land and waste management effectiving coastal marine environments.</narrative>
  </description>
